<title>USA: Coca-Cola bought back 2 mln shrs in Q2.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola bought back 2 mln shrs in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA, Ga. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Co said Thursday it bought back approximately 2.0 million common shares during the second quarter of the year.</p>
<p>The latest repurchase brought the year-to-date total of shares bought back to about 6.0 million, it said.</p>
<p>Since January 1984, it said it has bought back 31 percent of its common shares then outstanding or a cumulative total of more than one billion shares, at an average cost of about $11 a share.</p>
</text>
